{
  "assessment": "The source provides two temperature branches (T=10^-6 and T=1) for the incompressible kinetic energy E_i as a function of quench duration tau_Q, with fitted power laws and statistical details. The reviewer figure evidence confirms the applicability interval [100,1000] for both branches. The extracted cluster is complete and supports case authoring.",
